#
# Single violation: the free variable declaration names no math:variableDomain, so
# the exact-one typed-minimum restriction on math:FreeVariableDeclaration fails
# (math:UntypedFreeVariable).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:untypedFreeVariable a math:FreeVariableDeclaration .
